+---
+id: task-004-hourly-rentals
+type: task
+title: "Hourly rentals"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+# Request
+
+Let customers rent by the hour. `addEquipment` accepts an optional `hourlyPrice` (integer euro cents per hour).
+A rental shorter than a day that starts and ends on the hour is priced at the hourly price for each hour.
+An item without an hourly price cannot be rented by the hour.
+
+# Acceptance
+
+- `hourlyPrice`, when given, must be a non-negative integer number of cents; otherwise `addEquipment` throws.
+- A period under 24 hours, with `start` and `end` on UTC hours, totals hours x hourlyPrice (no long-stay discount).
+- Quoting or booking such a period for an item without `hourlyPrice` throws.
+- Periods of a day or more must still be whole UTC days; other periods throw.
+- Hourly bookings block overlapping periods; `availability` accepts hourly periods too.
